114
00:03:11.212 --> 00:03:12.314
[silbido de vapor]

115
00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.436
Bien, Sr. Alfred.

116
00:03:16.436 --> 00:03:17.725
Ha oído las acusaciones

117
00:03:17.725 --> 00:03:18.417
